<title>UK: Morgan Stanley leads 700 mln Swiss franc FRN.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley leads 700 mln Swiss franc FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CAPITAL ONE OFFERINGS LTD NO 1</p>
<p> AMT    700 MLN SFR   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  LEGAL MAT	  2005</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +3 BP     PAY DATE    30.JUN.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AAA	 ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   0.25</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AAA	 REOFFER    PAR</p>
<p> NOTES	EXPECTED MATURITY JUN.2002</p>
<p>		BACKED BY CAPITAL ONE MARKET TRUST SERIES 1997-1</p>
<p>		CLASS A CERTIFICATES</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 50	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/CI</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  0.10	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
